<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113999" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῑλι-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ</span>: gen. pl. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιλιάδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.28
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιλιαδέων</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				7.28
			</span></i>):—<i>a thousand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				341
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τέτορες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					91
				</span></i>
			; c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰς χιλιάδας ταλάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.96
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐννέα χιλιάδας ἐτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					257a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>large number,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				16.91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Herm.</u>
				56
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλαὶ χ.,</span> of lines of
			poetry, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Aet.Oxy.</u>
				2079.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χιλιάδες, αἱ,</span> title of poem by <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				10.436f
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιλιετηρίς</span>
			, Alex.Aetol.<i><span class="en">
				4.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ῥωμαϊκὴ χ.,</span> title of
			work by Asinius Quadratus, <i><span class="en">
				St.Byz.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀνθιον</span>
			 (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιλιαρχία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111
				</span></i>
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιλιετηρίς</span>).</div>
